 &lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;
     font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Prior to occupation, the applicant must
